  description: 
  title: Looping and Counters
  content: "Lesson 5: Looping and Counters\nObjective: Understand how to manage loops
    and counters.\nInstructions Covered:\nLOOP: Automatically decrements a counter
    register (CX) and jumps if not zero.\nExercise Application: In Exercise 7 (Jump
    Jackal), you\u2019ll set up a loop to control program flow and count down until
    a condition is met.\n\n"
